      },
      {
        "block_id": "BzlEdDq0HorE9Yx9GSecdUtBnyh",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "In <include target=\"milvus\">Milvus</include><include target=\"zilliz\">Zilliz Cloud</include>, complex filter expressions with numerous elements, especially those involving non-ASCII characters like CJK characters, can significantly affect query performance. To address this, <include target=\"milvus\">Milvus</include><include target=\"zilliz\">Zilliz Cloud</include> introduces a filter expression templating mechanism designed to improve efficiency by reducing the time spent parsing complex expressions. This page explains using filter expression templating in search, query, and delete operations.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "DvCIdhXY5oIta3x69DDcBTGkn0e",
        "block_type": 4,
        "heading2": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Overview",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "NpqDddbcnofyfNxNCfhchlCpnNp",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Filter expression templating allows you to create filter expressions with placeholders, which can be dynamically substituted with values during query execution. Using templating, you avoid embedding large arrays or complex expressions directly into the filter, reducing parsing time and improving query performance.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "RN1rdTZu6oQQM9xGlubcbunsn3d",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Let's say you have a filter expression involving two fields, ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "age",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": true,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " and ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "city",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": true,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", and you want to find all people whose age is greater than 25 and who live in either \"北京\" (Beijing) or \"上海\" (Shanghai). Instead of directly embedding the values in the filter expression, you can use a template:",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "Zcv8dcaqAogQT0x3WwacHMxnnWb",
        "block_type": 14,
        "code": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "filter = \"age > {age} AND city IN {city}\"\n",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "filter_params = {\"age\": 25, \"city\": [\"北京\", \"上海\"]}",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "language": 49,
            "wrap": false
          }
        },
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "O4qKdl1QgoQ4o1xS93xchRTunpd",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Here, ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "{age}",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": true,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " and ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "{city}",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": true,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " are placeholders that will be replaced with the actual values in ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "filter_params",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": true,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " when the query is executed.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "Ida4doELKo2YQhxUSzNcXY39nOd",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Using filter expression templating in <include target=\"milvus\">Milvus</include><include target=\"zilliz\">Zilliz Cloud</include> has several key advantages:",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "PzbQdkZFnoL9QkxGyYHcbEF8nzb",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Reduced Parsing Time",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ": By replacing large or complex filter expressions with placeholders, the system spends less time parsing and processing the filter.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "ViUDdhRRzoUdMaxvA2HcDc1gnEe",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Improved Query Performance",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ": With reduced parsing overhead, query performance improves, leading to higher QPS and faster response times.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "TZxLdaO5Do6yYex87uecZ861nbc",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Scalability",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ": As your datasets grow and filter expressions become more complex, templating ensures that performance remains efficient and scalable.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "parent_id": "QTCSdR1dYoI8DKxBzyhcQSDsnXt"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "JxFZdtZtao36EUxSesacoHX5nIb",
        "block_type": 4,
        "heading2": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Search Operations",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
